                        "entry_id": "51442aa0-6f80-3903-807f-b6ea60c5d879",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A bitter, destructive feud, normally between two families, clans, or factions, in which each injury or slaying is revenged: a blood feud."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "710f766c-4d1e-40b2-a0d9-8d2a869150cc",
                                "sense_id": "88a22709-19fb-3db1-a1d8-4f1550f11ed2",
                                "text": "The families had been locked in a bitter vendetta for generations."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44c88993-626e-32dd-96a8-5c881613025e",
                        "entry_id": "51442aa0-6f80-3903-807f-b6ea60c5d879",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A motivational grudge against a person or faction, which may or may not be reciprocated; the state of having it in for someone."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
